backend resolve <TEXT> [--limit COUNT] [--cursor CURSOR]

Turn a readable address into exact declarations, reporting ambiguity instead of guessing. Use when you have a name from prose or a stack trace and need the exact coordinates it could mean.

operands
  TEXT            A readable declaration name or address.

options
  --limit         Maximum rows in this page, 1 to 200.
  --cursor        Opaque continuation returned by the preceding page; bound to its query and index snapshot.

also spelled: name

